OL,3,GNEWSANew #4m college to train
OL,4,A'engineers of the future'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new #4m training facility for over
OL,7,F16s has opened in the West of England
OL,8,Fin a bid to develop the next generation
OL,9,Fof engineers and manufacturing
OL,10,Fprofessionals.
OL,12,FThe Advanced Manufacturing Technical
OL,13,FExcellence College (Amtec) opened on
OL,14,FMonday with almost 800 apprentices
OL,15,Fsigned up.
OL,17,FBased in Filton, near Bristol, it will
OL,18,Fallow them to learn alongside aerospace
OL,19,Fand engineering firms, including
OL,20,FAirbus, GKN, Rolls-Royce and BAE.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
