OL,3,GNEWSANew #4m college to train
OL,4,A'engineers of the future'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We have some of the world's leading
OL,7,Faerospace and engineering companies
OL,8,Fright on our doorstep," said Janet
OL,9,FStevens, deputy chief executive of
OL,10,FWeston College Group, which run Amtec.
